        'serious_side_effects_en' => 'Acute renal failure (due to crystallization in renal tubules], neurological toxicity (confusion, hallucinations, tremors], or thrombocytopenia.',
        'serious_side_effects_hi' => 'किडनी की तीव्र खराबी, न्यूरोलॉजिकल विषाक्तता (भ्रम, कंपकंपी) या खून की कमी।',
        'drug_interactions_en' => 'Interacts with other nephrotoxic medicines (aminoglycosides, tenofovir], and zidovudine (increases lethargy risk).',
